1
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
A Rose for Christmas is a drama, tv movie, romance film directed by Kevin Fair.

2
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Andy is a passionate artist whose family has been
building Rose Parade floats for generations.

3
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
When her Dad gets sick, Andy is forced to take the helm and supervise
the construction and decoration of their client's float.

4
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
And to make matters worse, she's saddled with the extra challenge of dealing with a
demanding businessman Cliff, whose company commissioned the float.

5
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Andy, played by Rachel Boston.

6
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Cliff, played by Marc Bendavid.

7
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:51,000
Lou, played by Nels Lennarson.

8
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Mr. Ellsworth, played by Daryl Shuttleworth.

9
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:21,000
Auctioneer, played by Jenson Kerr.

10
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Christine, played by Ali Milner.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
A Christmas Prince is a 2017 Christmas romantic comedy film directed by Alex Zamm, written by Karen Schaler and Nathan Atkins,
and stars Rose McIver, Ben Lamb, Tom Knight, Sarah Douglas, Daniel Fathers, Alice Krige, and Tahirah Sharif.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
The film was released on Netflix on November 17, 2017.

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
Two sequels, A Christmas Prince: The Royal Wedding, &, A
Christmas Prince: The Royal Baby came out a year apart.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
The film explores themes of new year's eve, holiday, artist, float, christmas.

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The tone is emotional.
